Package: tind-ai-remote
Version: 0.1.0~test2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: tind-ai-users, python3, systemd, nftables, ca-certificates, pkexec
Installed-Size: 72
Description: Tind AI box: the remote service (sends approved briefings to one provider)
 One service per provider (Scaleway, IONOS, Mistral, Anthropic, OpenAI or a
 custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint), each with only its own API key. Runs as
 tind-ai-remote: it can read the briefings, write the answers and reach only the
 selected provider's API host. Two adapters: OpenAI-compatible and the native
 Claude API.
